{"version":1,"name":"SAVE\\SAVGAMI.DAT","data":"","leads":[{"id":"council-commissions","title":"Council commissions","detail":"Rolf says to read the proclamations at City Hall and ask the clerk about commissions."},{"id":"phlan-training-schools","title":"Training in New Phlan","detail":"Rolf showed the party where adventurers train. Return to the training schools when a character is ready to advance."},{"id":"phlan-paid-rest","title":"Paid lodging in New Phlan","detail":"The lodging on the south side of New Phlan costs one platinum. Pay for a stay to rest and memorize spells."},{"id":"harbor-trade","title":"The sea lanes","detail":"Rolf says few ships risk the passage and the council wants to reopen it."},{"id":"phlan-training-directions","title":"Training school directions","detail":"From the notices, go north to train magic users or clerics. Go east to train fighters or rogues."},{"id":"phlan-training-north","title":"Doors at the northern training school","detail":"From the sign, use the east door for magic users and the west door for clerics."},{"id":"phlan-training-clerics","title":"Cleric training door","detail":"Use the west door at the northern training school. Accept the trainer's offer, select the cleric, then choose Train Character."},{"id":"phlan-training-fee","title":"Training costs 1,000 gold","detail":"The trainer quoted a fee of 1,000 gold. Check the selected character's coins and experience under View Character before returning."},{"id":"phlan-training-experience","title":"More experience needed","detail":"The trainer refused advancement for lack of experience. Earn more XP and check the character's progress under View Character."},{"id":"phlan-sune-healing","title":"Healing at the Temple of Sune","detail":"Priestess Joy of Sune offers healing in New Phlan."},{"id":"commission-ohlo","title":"Fetch Ohlo's potion - turned in","detail":"Ohlo drank his potion and settled the reward.","status":"turned-in"},{"id":"ohlo-rope-guild-entry","title":"The Rope Guild entrance","detail":"The party found the notice just north of the entrance to the Old Rope Guild."},{"id":"ohlo-rope-guild","title":"The Old Rope Guild","detail":"The party entered the former Rope Guild in the Slums."},{"id":"ohlo-booth","title":"The Rope Guild booth","detail":"The man in the booth says he has nothing to sell."},{"id":"ohlo-package-received","title":"The Rope Guild package","detail":"The booth merchant gave the party a package after hearing Ohlo's name. Bring it back to Ohlo."},{"id":"ohlo-delivered","title":"Ohlo drank the potion","detail":"Ohlo drank the potion, grew younger, and offered the promised reward."},{"id":"proclamation-lxiv","title":"Proclamation LXIV","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"proclamation-lxxviii","title":"Proclamation LXXVIII","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"proclamation-cix","title":"Proclamation CIX","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"proclamation-lix","title":"Proclamation LIX","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"commission-slums","title":"Clear the Slums - turned in","detail":"The council acknowledged the result.","status":"turned-in"},{"id":"commission-sokal","title":"Clear Sokal Keep - turned in","detail":"The council acknowledged the result.","status":"turned-in"},{"id":"commission-records","title":"Recover records of old Phlan - offered","detail":"Search the old city for historical records and bring worthwhile finds to the clerk.","status":"offered"},{"id":"commission-auction","title":"Investigate the auction - turned in","detail":"The council acknowledged the result.","status":"turned-in"},{"id":"phlan-arena-recruits","title":"Adventuring partners in New Phlan","detail":"The arena master can introduce adventurers who take a share of the party's treasure."},{"id":"phlan-training-fighters","title":"Fighter training door","detail":"Go east past the arena in New Phlan, then take the north door marked Fighters. Accept the trainer's offer and select Train Character."},{"id":"passage-sokal","title":"Passage to Sokal Keep","detail":"The harbor master says you can reach the keep by boat."},{"id":"sokal-arrival","title":"Arrival at Sokal Keep","detail":"The party landed on Thorn Island."},{"id":"sokal-reeds","title":"Reeds by the keep gate","detail":"The party saw a mound of reeds west of the gates."},{"id":"sokal-parchment","title":"The parchment at Sokal Keep","detail":"The party found a damaged scroll on a dead elf outside the keep."},{"id":"sokal-patrol-passed","title":"Sokal Keep patrol","detail":"The undead patrol accepted the word and let the party pass."},{"id":"sokal-ambush","title":"Sokal courtyard ambush","detail":"A large force of orcs and hobgoblins rushed the party through the courtyard door."},{"id":"sokal-courtyard-note","title":"Note from the courtyard","detail":"The party found a note on a fallen hobgoblin and copied it as journal entry 57."},{"id":"journal-entry-57","title":"Journal entry 57","detail":"The party encountered a reference to entry 57 in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"sokal-chapel","title":"Sokal Keep chapel","detail":"The party found the remains of two orcs in the doorway and a large altar against the south wall."},{"id":"sokal-pale-form","title":"The keep's pale figure","detail":"A pale figure appeared inside the keep. The party can try speaking to it."},{"id":"sokal-ferran","title":"Ferran Martinez","detail":"Ferran is bound to guard the keep and asks whether Phlan has been freed."},{"id":"sokal-phlan-fall","title":"Ferran's account of Phlan's fall","detail":"Ferran said creatures empowered by a magical pool overran Phlan. He named Tyranthraxus, Edranka, and Torath as their leaders."},{"id":"sokal-mendor","title":"Mendor's lost histories","detail":"Ferran says Mendor gathered accounts of the powers that brought down Phlan. His library was overrun."},{"id":"sokal-armory","title":"Sokal Keep armory","detail":"Ferran says help lies beyond an illusory wall in the armory."},{"id":"sokal-departure","title":"Ferran's password","detail":"Ferran told the party to say SAMOSUD to his guards on the way out."},{"id":"sokal-return-pier","title":"Boat back from Thorn Island","detail":"The party found a boat returning to New Phlan at the south pier."},{"id":"sokal-back-in-phlan","title":"Back in New Phlan","detail":"The party returned to New Phlan with the Sokal Keep report."},{"id":"phlan-temple-healing","title":"Healing at the Temple of Tyr","detail":"The priests at the Temple of Tyr in New Phlan offer healing."},{"id":"commission-textile","title":"Recover Cadorna's treasure - accepted","detail":"Go to the textile complex south of Podal Plaza. Search the western building for Cadorna's treasure.","status":"accepted"},{"id":"harbor-routes-reopened","title":"The harbor routes are open","detail":"The harbor master offers passage east, west, back to Sokal Keep, and to the north side of the bay."},{"id":"phlan-return-ferry","title":"Return ferry to New Phlan","detail":"Choose Take Boat at the dock to return to the civilized part of Phlan."},{"id":"auction-plaza-entry","title":"The crowd at Podal Plaza","detail":"The party can disguise itself as monsters or sneak past the crowd."},{"id":"auction-started","title":"The auction has begun","detail":"The auctioneer announced a powerful magical item to the crowd."},{"id":"auction-plaza-approach-chosen","title":"An approach to the auction","detail":"The party chose how to cross the crowd at Podal Plaza."},{"id":"auction-bidding","title":"The high bid","detail":"A man in plain clothes standing next to an ogre bid 5,000 gold pieces."},{"id":"auction-ogre-searched","title":"The ogre had no item","detail":"The ogre was tackled and searched after fleeing the auction. He did not have the item."},{"id":"commission-bane","title":"Follow up with the Temple of Tyr - offered","detail":"Speak with Bishop Braccio at Tyr's temple about his summons.","status":"offered"},{"id":"commission-kovel","title":"Clear Kovel Mansion - ready to report","detail":"Return to the council clerk at City Hall to report your success.","status":"ready-to-report"},{"id":"kovel-chase","title":"Thieves in Kovel Mansion","detail":"Two thieves fled through the east door after their attack failed."},{"id":"kovel-thieves-split","title":"The thieves split up","detail":"One ran east and the other ran south."},{"id":"kovel-thief-ambush","title":"Mansion ambush","detail":"Thieves attacked the party inside the mansion."},{"id":"kovel-thief-ambush-cleared","title":"Mansion ambush cleared","detail":"The party defeated the thieves who set the ambush."}],"party":{"SAVE\\CHRDATI1.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATI1.ITM":"","SAVE\\CHRDATI1.SPC":"awAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATI2.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATI2.ITM":"","SAVE\\CHRDATI2.SPC":"awAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATI3.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATI3.ITM":"C0xvbmcgU3dvcmQgU3dvcmQgICAgICAgICAgICAxNQAAAAAAAAAAAAAACADiPCQAACQAAAEAADwAAA8AAAAADSBZZXMgIFNoaWVsZCAgICAgICAgICAgICAgICAxNQAAAAAAAAAAAAAACADmPDsAADsAAAEAAGQAAA8AAAAADEJhbmRlZCBNYWlsICBNYWlsICAgICAgICAgICA5MAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADkAMDkAAAEAAF4BAFoAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATI3.SPC":"awAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATI4.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATI4.ITM":"","SAVE\\CHRDATI5.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATI5.ITM":"","SAVE\\CHRDATI5.SPC":"fAAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATI6.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATI6.ITM":"","SAVE\\CHRDATI6.SPC":"awAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATI7.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATI7.ITM":"BU1hY2UgAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACACUPRcAABcAAAEAADIAAAMAAAAAC1BsYXRlIE1haWwgAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADoAMDoAAAEAAMIBAJABAAAA"},"automap":{"0":{"cells":{"11,2":{"x":11,"y":2,"walls":[1,0,13,0],"passage":[1,0,1,0]},"5,2":{"x":5,"y":2,"walls":[0,12,0,0],"passage":[0,1,0,0]},"4,3":{"x":4,"y":3,"walls":[0,0,11,0],"passage":[0,0,1,0]},"1,4":{"x":1,"y":4,"walls":[13,